/P 114 0 R
/E (The forthcoming Payment Services Directive \(PSD3\) and Payment Services Regulation \(PSR\) are designed to clarify this overlap. The negotiated text narrows the circumstances in which EMT activity is treated as a payment service, creates express exclusions for many investment and trading flows, and streamlines the authorisation process where a CASP genuinely needs payment permissions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
178 0 obj
<<
